  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is to enable China to fulfill its commitments under the UNFCCC to prepare its first biennial transparency report (1BTR) by the end of 2024, as required by the Paris Agreement and its implementing rules. Building on the experience of submitting four National Communications (NCs) and three Biennial Update Reports (BURs), the project will expand and consolidate its network of contacts with stakeholders to organically include entities from various sectors, including governments, universi</narrative>
  </description>
